# 🤖 AI AGENTS CONFIGURATION - FORESTECH

> **For GitHub Copilot, Claude, ChatGPT, and other AI coding assistants working on this project**

## 🚨 **CRITICAL DEPLOYMENT INFO**

### **ACTIVE WORKFLOWS (Only 3)**
1. ✅ **Deploy to Firebase** - Frontend (auto + manual)
2. ✅ **Deploy to Cloud Run** - Backend (manual only) 
3. ✅ **E2E Tests** - Automated testing

### **DEPLOYMENT COMMANDS**
```bash
# Frontend Changes (Auto-deploy)
git push origin main  # ✅ Automatically deploys Firebase

# Backend Changes (Manual deploy required)  
git push origin main  # No auto-deploy (by design)
# Then: GitHub Actions → "🚀 Deploy to Cloud Run" → force_deploy: true

# Manual Frontend Deploy (with target selection)
# GitHub Actions → "🚀 Deploy to Firebase" → Select: all|combustibles|alimentacion
```

## 🏗️ **ARCHITECTURE**

### **Dual System Design**
- **🔥 Firebase**: React apps + hosting + SSR + auth
- **☁️ Cloud Run**: SQL backend + Azure Database + APIs

### **DO NOT Mix These Systems**
- ❌ Don't create SQL functions in Firebase Functions
- ❌ Don't suggest disabled workflows
- ❌ Don't use deprecated deploy scripts
- ✅ Frontend goes to Firebase
- ✅ Backend/SQL goes to Cloud Run

## 🌐 **PRODUCTION URLs**
- **Combustibles**: https://combustibles.forestechdecolombia.com.co
- **Alimentación**: https://forestechdecolombia.web.app/alimentacion
- **Backend API**: https://forestech-sql-service-851382130132.us-central1.run.app

## 📁 **PROJECT STRUCTURE**
```
forestech/
├── combustibles/           # React app (fuel management)
├── alimentacion/           # React app (food liquidations)
├── functions/              # Firebase Functions (SSR only)
├── public/                 # Built apps
│   ├── combustibles/       # Built combustibles app
│   └── alimentacion/       # Built alimentacion app
├── .github/workflows/      # Only 3 active workflows
├── DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md     # Complete deployment guide
└── QUICK_DEPLOY_CARD.md    # Quick reference
```

## 🔧 **DEVELOPMENT COMMANDS**
```bash
# Local Development
npm run dev:combustibles    # Port 5174
npm run dev:alimentacion    # Port 5173

# Building
npm run build:all           # Build both apps
npm run build:combustibles  # Build only combustibles  
npm run build:alimentacion  # Build only alimentacion

# Testing
npm run test --workspace=combustibles
npm run lint:check
```

## 🚨 **CRITICAL RULES FOR AI AGENTS**

### **❌ NEVER Suggest These (Deprecated)**
- `npm run deploy` (old deployment method)
- Disabled workflows (*.yml.disabled files)
- Creating SQL functions in Firebase Functions
- Manual deployment scripts in `/scripts/`

### **✅ ALWAYS Suggest These**
- Push to main for frontend auto-deploy
- Manual deploy via GitHub Actions for backend
- Check DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md for procedures
- Use Cloud Run for SQL operations

## 🎯 **COMMON SCENARIOS**

### **User wants to deploy frontend changes**
```bash
git push origin main  # Auto-deploys Firebase
```

### **User wants to deploy backend changes**
```bash
git push origin main  # Pushes code (no auto-deploy)
# Then manually: GitHub Actions → "🚀 Deploy to Cloud Run"
```

### **User asks about workflows**
Only mention these 3 active workflows:
- 🔥 Deploy to Firebase
- ☁️ Deploy to Cloud Run  
- 🧪 Combustibles E2E Tests

### **User asks about deployment issues**
Direct them to:
1. DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md (complete guide)
2. QUICK_DEPLOY_CARD.md (quick reference)
3. GitHub Actions logs
4. Firebase/Cloud Run consoles

